sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as Player (NetworkBehaviour)
  participant SVR as ServerPlayerVesselInitializer
  participant CLI as ClientPlayerVesselInitializer
  participant GD as GameDataSO
  P->>P: OnNetworkSpawn — set NetName, NetDomain, NetDefaultVesselType
  P->>SVR: raise OnPlayerNetworkSpawnedUlong(clientId)
  SVR->>SVR: wait preSpawnDelayMs (200ms) for NetworkVariables
  SVR->>SVR: SpawnVesselForPlayer — Instantiate + InjectRecursive + SpawnWithOwnership
  SVR->>CLI: InitializePlayerAndVessel()
  CLI->>GD: AddPlayer — set LocalPlayer, assign spawn pose
  CLI->>GD: InvokeClientReady() (local user only)
  SVR->>SVR: wait postSpawnDelayMs (200ms) for replication
  SVR-->>CLI: NotifyClients → InitializeAllPlayersAndVessels ClientRpc
  Note over SVR,CLI: AI variant pre-spawns with destroyWithScene=false to survive the scene-load tick
